  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>• Brand introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">\"Ms. Chu Soap &amp; Beaut creates natural skincare products that are functional and effective on eczema and sensitive skin while making a positive impact socially, environmentally, and on all of our well-being. Suitable for eczema, sensitive, G6PD, and all skin types from new borns to grown up.\"</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>• Product description:</strong></p><div class=\"product-block\"><div class=\"rte\"><p><span>Try our popular 3-pack baby combo that can effectively reduce&nbsp;and prevent baby eczema.</span></p><p><span>Combo includes:</span></p><p><span>·&nbsp;</span>Baby Lotion 100mL *1</p><p><span>·&nbsp;</span>No No Itchy Gel 30mL *1</p><p><span>·&nbsp;</span>Baby Shampoo &amp; Body Wash 250mL *1</p><p>OR</p><p><span>·&nbsp;</span>Baby Bath Oil 100mL*1</p><p><a title=\"Organic Baby Lotion\" href=\"https://www.mschusoapandbeaut.com/collections/all-products/products/organic-baby-lotion\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"js-no-transition\" rel=\"noopener\"><u><span>·&nbsp;Baby Lotion 100mL</span></u></a></p><p>Organic Baby Lotion is a rich and nourishing humectant for chapped and dried skin on the hands, face and body. The combination of organic cocoa butter, shea butter, aloe vera, oatmeal colloidal, calendula and chamomile oils work to soothe dry and itchy skin as well as to&nbsp;help skin replenish and nourish.</p><p><a title=\"No No Itchy Gel\" href=\"https://www.mschusoapandbeaut.com/collections/all-products/products/no-no-itchy-gel\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"js-no-transition\" rel=\"noopener\"><u><span>·&nbsp;No No Itchy Gel 30mL</span></u></a></p><p>This natural&nbsp;gel helps soothe itchiness, and ingredients such as&nbsp;aloe vera, tea tree oil, calendula and chamomile oil moisturize skin and promote healing.</p><p><a title=\"Baby Shampoo &amp; Body Wash\" href=\"https://www.mschusoapandbeaut.com/collections/all-products/products/baby-shampoo-body-wash\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"js-no-transition\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><u>·&nbsp;</u></span><u><span>Baby Shampoo &amp; Body Wash (Advanced Formula) 250mL</span></u> &nbsp;</a></p><p>This advanced formula retains the soothing effect of our original Baby Shampoo &amp; Wash, the addition of moisturising factors such as Aloe Vera Leaf Juice and Lecithin&nbsp;make this formulation even more nourishing and suitable for dry seasons.</p><p>OR</p><p><a href=\"https://www.mschusoapandbeaut.com/collections/all-products/products/baby-bath-oil\" title=\"Baby Bath Oil\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"js-no-transition\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;<u><span>·&nbsp;Baby&nbsp;Bath Oil 100mL</span></u></a></p><p>Suitable for the whole family; use on face and body, Baby Bath Oil helps to soothe itchy skin and moisturises dried skin.</p><p>Feel free to chat with us anytime if you have other&nbsp;special orders in mind!</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p></div></div><div class=\"product-block\"><div class=\"rte metafield-icons\"><ul><li><span class=\"icon-and-text\"><span>For Baby or Mild Eczema</span></span></li><li><span class=\"icon-and-text\"><span>Dermatologist Recommended</span></span></li><li><span class=\"icon-and-text\"><span>No Steroid</span></span></li><li><span class=\"icon-and-text\"><span>Natural &amp; Organic</span></span></li><li><span class=\"icon-and-text\"><span>Food Grade Clean Beaut</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
